n! Highly Recommended!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJrwTTT-Dn_text","label":"ggJrwTTT-Dn_text","default":"<p>Daniel J.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrjfAuv4Df_text","label":"ggrjfAuv4Df_text","default":"Karen M.⁩"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbArTTVUSt_text","label":"ggbArTTVUSt_text","default":"<p>I started using Pure Shilajit Gold Resin in early October and wanted to use it thoroughly before reviewing. I've been taking two doses a day: one in the morning and one at night. Initially, the taste was strong and overpowering, but I got used to it after a week. It paired better with tea than coffee due to its earthy taste. For convenience, I found the easiest method was to dip a butter knife in the resin, place it on my tongue, let it dissolve, and swallow.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Regarding energy and focus, I didn't notice a sudden burst or significant increase. The first night, I stayed up briefly, but after that, my sleep was unaffected. My morning workouts didn't see a noticeable difference in stamina either. There was a slight uptick in focus throughout the day, but nothing drastic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What I did notice was an improvement in digestion. Overall, as someone who leads a healthy lifestyle—avoiding fast food, processed food, and eating out, exercising daily, and taking vitamins and fish oil—there wasn't a dramatic change except for better digestion. Still, I think the product is a worthwhile complement to a healthy routine.</p>"}],
